module Core

### Represents wrappers that transparently forward the read API of an entity.
### `Referring[T]` is the borrowed read-only abstraction used when an API needs
### safe access to an entity without transferring ownership.
### :typeparam T: The referenced entity type.
protocol Referring[T]
needs T is EntityType
  ### Yields the inner entity as an in-flight `T` reference for read-only access.
  ### Implicitly inserted by the compiler at call sites whose target parameter is
  ### `Referring[T]` and whose argument is any obeyer of `Referring[T]`.
  ### :returns: The inner entity as `T` (scoped borrow shape).
  @readonly
  routine Me.refer() -> T
